The texts of law in this repository are reglamentos and other general provisions of the Municipio de Guadalajara
(Jalisco, Mexico), taken from Portal de Transparencia del Gobierno de Guadalajara (transparencia.guadalajara.gob.mx), "Los reglamentos federales, estatales y municipales" (art. 8, fr. II, inc. d), list of reglamentos municipales vigentes, https://transparencia.guadalajara.gob.mx/articulo-8/ii-la-informacion-sobre-el-marco-juridico-aplicable-al-y-por-el-sujeto-obligado-que-comprende/d-los-reglamentos-federales-estatales-y-municipales (consulted 2026-10-31).

Copyright: they are not protected by copyright in Mexico. Ley Federal del Derecho de Autor, art. 14: "No son objeto de la protección como derecho de autor a que se refiere esta Ley: [...] VIII. Los textos legislativos, reglamentarios, administrativos o judiciales, así como sus traducciones oficiales. En caso de ser publicados, deberán apegarse al texto oficial y no conferirán derecho exclusivo de edición".
They are reproduced here following the official text.

Attribution: Fuente: Gobierno Municipal de Guadalajara, https://transparencia.guadalajara.gob.mx/articulo-8/ii-la-informacion-sobre-el-marco-juridico-aplicable-al-y-por-el-sujeto-obligado-que-comprende/d-los-reglamentos-federales-estatales-y-municipales.

Changes made by Lexifina: each text was split into one Markdown file per article, one paragraph per line, with spacing
normalised; the wording was not changed. The municipality does not endorse this repository. This repository is not an
official publication; the binding text is the one published in the Gaceta Municipal de Guadalajara.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
